  "source_notes": "Wikimedia is also an upstream source of some AI4Bharat datasets. This is independent collection/selection from primary publishers, not proof of wholly independent authorship. Exact/whitespace-equivalent overlaps excluded; partial overlaps and near duplicates may remain. Samples are unequal and small: especially Bodo/Dogri, Kashmiri, Manipuri, Santali. No native orthographic validation or speech/acoustic evaluation. Sindhi in this manifest is Arabic only; separate Devanagari Sindhi source required. Unicode UDHR is archival legal text and may contain legacy orthography."
